Package: dataitd24
Title: FAIRqual Workshop Data from ITD24
Version: 0.1.0
Description: Contains digitized flipchart data and qualitative analysis results
    from the FAIRqual workshop at the International Transdisciplinary Conference
    (ITD24) in Utrecht, November 2024. The workshop gathered experiences and
    perspectives on sharing qualitative data in transdisciplinary research.
